    "html": "<p>Monochromatic light is incident on a single slit of width <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span> and produces a diffraction pattern on a screen that is at a distance <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span> from the slit. Which one of the following changes will cause the angle between the central maximum and the first minimum to decrease?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">Increasing <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">Increasing <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">Decreasing <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"a\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">Decreasing <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"b\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
